    {
      "id": "r4t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 475,
      "y": 265,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "processTask() — background\n────────────────────────────\n1. createWorkspace(sessionId)\n   → mkdir data/workspaces/{sessionId}\n2. loadMcpToolsForUser(userId)\n3. loadCustomTools(agentConfig, meta)\n   → filters tools by agentSlug\n   → pgm tools only for pgm-agent\n4. runTask(..., cwd=workspaceDir)\n   → LLM agent loop in isolated dir\n5. getAttachments() + getPendingQuestions()\n6. sendCallback(result, attachments,\n   pendingQuestions)\n7. deleteWorkspace(sessionId)  [finally]",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775043960017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": "r4",
      "originalText": "processTask() — background\n────────────────────────────\n1. createWorkspace(sessionId)\n   → mkdir data/workspaces/{sessionId}\n2. loadMcpToolsForUser(userId)\n3. loadCustomTools(agentConfig, meta)\n   → filters tools by agentSlug\n   → pgm tools only for pgm-agent\n4. runTask(..., cwd=workspaceDir)\n   → LLM agent loop in isolated dir\n5. getAttachments() + getPendingQuestions()\n6. sendCallback(result, attachments,\n   pendingQuestions)\n7. deleteWorkspace(sessionId)  [finally]",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
