    {
      "id": "fs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1105,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "src/\n├── main.ts              Express server, health check, graceful shutdown\n├── config.ts            SERVER, PATHS, LITELLM, AGENT env vars\n├── agent.ts             runTask(..., cwd?) — LLM agent loop + Digital Twin prompt\n├── custom-tools.ts      loadCustomTools(agentConfig, meta) → tools + attachments\n├── mcp.ts               loadMcpToolsForUser(userId) → proxy to auth service\n├── workspace.ts         createWorkspace / deleteWorkspace — per-session isolation\n├── store.ts             initStore() — create data directory\n├── lock.ts              File-based advisory locks (session JSONL safety)\n├── routes/\n│   └── run.ts           POST /run — workspace → process → cleanup\n├── middleware/\n│   └── auth.ts          validateS2SKey — X-S2S-Key header check\n└── types/\n    └── request.ts       JwtPayload, AuthenticatedRequest interfaces\n\ndata/workspaces/{sessionId}/   ← created per request, deleted after callback",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775043960017,
      "link": null,
