      "text": "Environment Variables:\n  XYNE_CLAW_PORT=3002\n  XYNE_CLAW_S2S_KEY=...           S2S auth key\n  XYNE_CLAW_AUTH_URL=:3003       Auth service URL\n  XYNE_CLAW_DATA_DIR=./data      Working directory\n  XYNE_CLAW_THINKING=medium      off|low|medium|high\n  LITELLM_URL=:4000              Model proxy\n  LITELLM_API_KEY=...            API key\n  LITELLM_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4  Default model",
